{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20489","headline":"和李仆射雨中寄卢严二给事 · 张籍","name":"和李仆射雨中寄卢严二给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郊原飞雨至，城阙湿云埋。\n迸点时穿牖，浮沤欲上堦。\n偏滋解箨竹，并洒落花槐。\n晚润生琴匣，新凉满药斋。\n从容朝务退，放旷掖曹乖。\n尽日无来客，闲吟感此怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}